edical insurance fee • (3) a waiver of on-campus dorm fee • (4) monthly stipend (bachelor''s students: 2500) • ——Partial Scholarship (Type B): • (1) a waiver of tuition fee • (2) a waiver of medical insurance fee', 'AGE Min Age: 16 Max Age: 25 GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 6 TOEFL iBT: min. 72 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE HSK: HSK Level 4 STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Optional) A-Level, IB DOCUMENTS Apply online for studying at DHU: https://admissions.dhu.edu.cn Fill out the online application blanks step by step and upload the following application materials: I.  All uploaded electronic documents must be scanned pieces of the original. Except for the ID photo, colored scan in PDF format of the documents is recommended. II.  Original documents not in the language of Chinese or English must be translated into Chinese or English, then be notarized, and uploaded together with the original ones. III.  The original artwork must be uploaded online in the format required. IV.  Please be sure to complete online application and application fee payment before the application deadline. In any case, the application materials and application fee will not be returned. 1．Passpor', 'Schoters', 'https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/shanghai-government-scholarship-sgs-donghua-university-124', 'https://english.dhu.edu.cn/admissions/list.htm', '[-0.06375696510076523, -0.015483571216464043, -0.002588477684184909, -0.05768609419465065, -0.014250245876610279, 0.004392943345010281, -0.06749365478754044, 0.08612002432346344, -0.004367666319012642, 0.018676821142435074, 0.03209492564201355, -0.015605220571160316, -0.07867515087127686, 0.03039131872355938, -0.11403695493936539, -0.03678598627448082, -0.02922515571117401, 0.02719414234161377, -0.07589327543973923, -0.08278818428516388, 0.02594701386988163, -0.046926457434892654, 0.07383514195680618, -0.02547997608780861, -0.03852050378918648, -0.03550398722290993, -0.027195582166314125, -0.00032166470191441476