nder this award.', 'AGE No age requirement GPA Min. GPA: 3 out of 4.00 ENGLISH TEST Not required NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS English proficiency Most recent academic transcript Some ANU programs need you to meet additional requirements, including providing proof of relevant work experience. You can check if your preferred program has additional requirements on https://programsandcourses.anu.edu.au/ ( https://programsandcourses.anu.edu.au/ ) If you are applying for a postgraduate program, to obtain admission based on professional experience, you will need to provide: a curriculum vitae clearly identifying periods of full-time and part-time professional experience; the contact details of two referees who can verify the experience; a statement addressing the relevant learning outcomes of the program as specified in Policy: Recognition of Prior and External Learning; A statement from the employer confirming relevant experience, alternative eviden', 'Schoters', 'https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/australian-national-university-anu-hdr-fee-merit-scholarship-126', 'https://study.anu.edu.au/scholarships/find-scholarship/anu-hdr-fee-merit-scholarship', '[-0.04458137974143028, 0.010457669384777546, 0.008473137393593788, -0.024742797017097473, -0.0014534876681864262, -0.049301132559776306, -0.06874249130487442, 0.06069548428058624, -0.0387544259428978, -0.0018285184632986784, -0.04492693766951561, -0.10755240172147751, -0.01977309212088585, 0.022648636251688004, -0.07901079952716827, -0.014128590933978558, -0.11758372187614441, -0.01816106028854847, -0.05893471837043762, -0.07763541489839554, -0.0005952742067165673, 0.006876286584883928, 0.011167827993631363, -0.02086023800075054, -0.022714754566550255, 0.03788994997739792, -0.020354360342025757, 0.03200679272413254, 0.009170884266495705, -0.006130407564342022, -0.02335631288588047, 0.12926912307739258, 0.0066698817536234856, -0.09511017054319382, 0.077418386936