omas and certification documents should be made available upon registration for review. 5. Language Proficiency Certificate: marked under the “Application Requirements” section. 6. One Letter of Recommendation with information of the recommender’s names, employer, work position and contact information, signed by the recommender or with the stamp', 'Schoters', 'https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/xiamen-university-new-international-students-scholarships-137', 'https://admissions.xmu.edu.cn/info/1061/3880.htm', '[-0.029185162857174873, -0.018703898414969444, 0.020501231774687767, -0.03183149918913841, 0.021915672346949577, -0.03561054915189743, -0.03850223496556282, 0.05534881725907326, 0.04175009950995445, 0.026607993990182877, 0.06497397273778915, -0.04600206017494202, -0.03962021321058273, -0.037815794348716736, -0.09337405860424042, -0.0461733378469944, -0.019755149260163307, -0.03553937375545502, -0.05668741464614868, -0.08526194095611572, 0.03646482527256012, -0.06825273483991623, 0.07785884290933609, -0.05879444628953934, 0.015933237969875336, -0.037328090518713, -0.003847456304356456, -0.0522887222468853, 0.04065806791186333, -0.002238202141597867, -0.042485311627388, 0.08700870722532272, -0.025613294914364815, 0.0032122156117111444, 0.022336240857839584, 0.07221801578998566, 0.003950286656618118, -0.06433321535587311, 0.000928696128539741, 0.02131512016057968, 0.020331906154751778, -0.01331045851111412, 0.03445944935083389, -0.006117309909313917, 0.08355079591274261, -0.056863799691200256, -0.04201274737715721, -0.04754118621349335, -0.044002506881952286, 0.03314517065882683, -0.1603802591562271, 0.030682561919093132, 0.008906605653464794, 0.008687973953783512, -0.025453926995396614, -0.00512879341840744, 0.02990446612238884, 0.011021286249160767, -0.10017253458499908, -0.026203718036413193, 0.02736491709947586, 0.029442772269248962, -0.026241665706038475, 0.004153741989284754, -0.05036204680800438, -0.031103545799851418, -0.07622463256120682, 0.022546740248