rt or ID card). 5.3 Applicants should provide the f', 'Schoters', 'https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/shanghai-jiao-tong-university-sjtu-global-college-scholarships-173', 'https://global.sjtu.edu.cn/en/study-sjtu/prospective', '[-0.11526605486869812, 0.04348939657211304, 0.03502742201089859, -0.018483344465494156, 0.049529001116752625, -0.04471191391348839, -0.05665865167975426, -0.014066917821764946, -0.0030970268417149782, 0.018187720328569412, 0.031243624165654182, -0.048622529953718185, -0.020815379917621613, -0.00666093872860074, -0.09106209129095078, -0.04424561187624931, -0.037405796349048615, -0.03134951367974281, -0.06541833281517029, -0.11957816779613495, 0.005619889125227928, -0.09038077294826508, 0.05446764826774597, -0.07724598795175552, 8.681208419147879e-05, -0.0993042141199112, -0.006055295467376709, 0.0021199004258960485, 0.010469994507730007, -0.005775345489382744, -0.042686477303504944, 0.0694565549492836, -0.06961067020893097, 0.06656469404697418, 0.026148075237870216, 0.08349423855543137, -0.028433293104171753, -0.030071407556533813, 0.02629796788096428, -0.042328160256147385, 0.028991399332880974, 0.03981231898069382, 0.06473586708307266, -0.07499544322490692, 0.05925626680254936, -0.05867401510477066, -0.06463413685560226, -0.04176359251141548, -0.036381110548973083, -0.00479211937636137, -0.05174015462398529, -0.00636596092954278, 0.015790168195962906, -0.036607056856155396, -0.028643595054745674, 0.05081383138895035, 0.056731317192316055, -0.02798645570874214, -0.04450254887342453, -0.04052106663584709, -0.04334762692451477, -0.0072127291932702065, -0.03618580847978592, 0.022624896839261055, -0.04760094732046127, -0.02968946099281311, -0.0008562807342968881, 0.06847123056650162, 0.01656859554350376, 0.0054122526198625565, 0.047725897282361984, -0.06231348216533661, -0.06957782059907913, 0.010821378789842129, 0.010796956717967987, 0.04685049504041672, 0.015275959856808186, 0.05268516018986702, 0.08880483359098434, 0.03725747391581535, 0.011