t Photo 4. Language Proficiency Certificate (The language proficiency certificate must be within the validity period) （a）Programs taught in Chinese：①A minimum score of 180 in HSK4 certification for Science and Engineering ②A minimum score of 180 in HSK5 certification for Liberal Arts, Medicine, Arts （b）Programs taught in English：IELTS 5.5 or above, TOEFL IBT 80 or above (Excluding English native speaker) 5. Foreigner Physical Examination Form 6. Resume (from primary school to now) 7.Appli', 'Schoters', 'https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/shenzhen-university-international-scholarship-185', 'https://lxs.szu.edu.cn/', '[-0.0781404972076416, 0.031967051327228546, 0.011641283519566059, -0.03772890940308571, 0.013145959936082363, -0.1173921525478363, 0.02632690593600273, 0.03023296594619751, 0.01498785987496376, 0.03187164291739464, 0.020250588655471802, -0.020727114751935005, 0.04931042343378067, -0.03365154564380646, -0.032706864178180695, 0.011396976187825203, -0.03323518857359886, -0.04995696619153023, -0.06881915777921677, -0.08214803040027618, 0.028126446530222893, -0.11923296749591827, 0.03667135536670685, -0.07893398404121399, -0.030541103333234787, -0.027707967907190323, 0.02075863629579544, 0.0026973362546414137, -0.024539509788155556, -0.08209767937660217, -0.04535093531012535, 0.13883116841316223, 0.04459086060523987, 0.03856756538152695, 0.012704392895102501, 0.0809565857052803, -0.023788325488567352, -0.07153505086898804, -0.013814347796142101, 0.0018291972810402513, -0.017252948135137558, 0.004017801024019718, 0.054357703775167465, -0.05280046910047531, 0.04165814444422722, -0.023087138310074806, -0.010714709758758545, -0.01617731899023056, -0.04789871722459793, -0.0039971936494112015, -0.10751409828662872, -0.0092678377404809, 0.00920625776052475, 0.008010776713490486, -0.032197725027799606, 0.02490905486047268, 0.06818080693483353, 0.011185297742486, -0.0525997020304203, -0.055324338376522064, 0.015107066370546818, 0.0011150478385388851, -0.027742803096