ates are yet to be issued, a letter from the school stating predicted grades is required. TOEFL or IELTS certificates (original, plus an extra copy) if any. Passport For UAE Nationals: front page and unified number page For UAE Residents: Copy of passport name page and visa permit page For International students outside the UAE: Copy of passport name page Passport size photograph OTHERS Shortlisted applicants will be requ', 'Schoters', 'https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/middle-east-khalifa-university-undergraduate-scholarships-for-international-students-260', 'https://www.ku.ac.ae/undergraduate-scholarships', '[-0.06816054880619049, -0.021708782762289047, 0.009260670281946659, -0.0104667441919446, 0.004058241844177246, -0.0975678563117981, -0.06719938665628433, 0.0335303358733654, 0.002520144684240222, 0.014700444415211678, 0.022416172549128532, -0.07745547592639923, 0.013460179790854454, -0.002992340363562107, -0.06341259926557541, 0.018764128908514977, -0.045220665633678436, -0.02277161180973053, -0.07023727893829346, -0.10652504861354828, -0.00857876893132925, -0.05729047209024429, 0.04902175813913345, -0.025103582069277763, -0.025568179786205292, -0.013411329127848148, 0.03573378920555115, 0.02711774967610836, -0.023366861045360565, -0.04132642224431038, -0.019779430702328682, 0.09740124642848969, -0.04735713079571724, -0.04029205068945885, 0.054014746099710464, 0.1497277170419693, -0.10583175718784332, -0.05187484622001648, 0.0075164539739489555, -0.026569006964564323, 0.04108164831995964, -0.0655917227268219, 0.05590517446398735, -0.012542991898953915, 0.07202138751745224, -0.05247671902179718, -0.01676418073475361, -0.021296793594956398, 0.042627159506082535, -0.023330604657530785, -0.10533536225557327, -0.013927831314504147, 0.01849747635424137, -0.026854829862713814, -0.009422669187188148, -0.02769424580037594, -0.040169667452573776, -0.030577611178159714, -0.02707570418715477, -0.05979884788393974, 0.02244097739458084, 0.03563897684216499, -0.0595267750