rama, music, or sport. • Up to 20 awards of up to £3,000 are made each year (Scholarships range between £1,000 and £3,000 per year.) The scholarship is awarded for three years of study, as long as you meet the criteria for renewal.', 'AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 88 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Required) A-Level, International Baccalaureate DOCUMENTS UCAS Application scholarship application: Vice-Chancellor''s Scholarship application form supporting reference from referee OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.', 'Schoters', 'https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/university-of-bristol-vice-chancellor-s-scholarship-274', 'https://www.bristol.ac.uk/students/support/finances/scholarships/', '[-0.03369510546326637, -0.03069070354104042, -0.003391595557332039, -0.07608353346586227, -0.01558156032115221, -0.008294576779007912, -0.08653062582015991, 0.07067279517650604, -0.008461950346827507, 0.05128283426165581, -0.02495565079152584, -0.021240146830677986, -0.03805246949195862, 0.04141750559210777, -0.12191254645586014, -0.0031243280973285437, -0.0634550228714943, -0.01378176175057888, -0.08465128391981125, -0.032068561762571335, 0.02618851698935032, 0.028055747970938683, 0.0726470947265625, 0.002511523896828294, -0.021652214229106903, -0.03685346990823746, -0.040862612426280975, 0.034949108958244324, 0.0018143524648621678, 0.0013085503596812487, -0.018314115703105927, 0.13130292296409607, 0.013393089175224304, -0.07689441740512848, 0.03211275860667229, 0.04520731419324875, -0.03804086148738861, -0.027449633926153183, 0.00846321415156126, 0.05895715951919556, 0.006344543769955635, -0.04255549982190132, -0.028415821492671967, 0.029806680977344513, 0.10453902930021286, -0.02784176915884018, -0.015217441134154797, -0.08460027724504471, -0.004880285821855068, -0.024808000773191452, -0.1541869342327118, -0.005233426578342915, -0.002142159501090646, -0.