ments, submitted directly by your referees 3. Students not currently registered in a graduate program at Guelph must submit a complete application for admission to a graduate program at Guelph 4. Current University of Guelph master''s students applying for doctoral funding who are not eligible as master''s applicants must also submit a online OUAC application for admission to a doctoral program. NOTE: Transcripts are not required as part of your OGS application; they will be accessed from your application for admission. 5. Statement of Interest/Plan of Study/Research Proposal OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.', 'Schoters', 'https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/ontario-graduate-scholarship-ogs-program-university-of-guelph-354', 'https://graduatestudies.uoguelph.ca/funding/ogs', '[-0.01290130615234375, -0.03819403424859047, -0.01120817568153143, -0.031594131141901016, 0.006526054814457893, 0.002956331940367818, -0.06407511234283447, 0.08251944929361343, 0.0005358586786314845, 0.030623238533735275, 0.023601973429322243, -0.13297908008098602, -0.11450870335102081, 0.0435255691409111, -0.08580786734819412, -0.03569459542632103, -0.03179340809583664, 0.020578766241669655, -0.04734591022133827, -0.035738248378038406, 0.026250917464494705, -0.05364382266998291, 0.1445428878068924, -0.027228806167840958, 0.003622959600761533, -0.08587858825922012, -0.007677968591451645, -0.008895877748727798, -0.04948338493704796, -0.019015315920114517, -0.03493396192789078, 0.11769265681505203, -0.0264882855117321, -0.0028130991850048304, 0.053396593779325485, 0.07789452373981476, -0.020307466387748718, -0.11820226162672043, 0.0018687820993363857, 0.045624956488609314, 0.002408284228295088, -0.031064968556165695, -0.007329754997044802, 0.001158945495262742, 0.08932946622371674, -0.043776463717222214, -0.05073470622301102, -0.03278737515211105, -0.04318546503782272, 0.002711551496759057, -0.11872094124555588, -0.04113766551017761, -0.00021012617798987776, 0.029940685257315636,