ment of € 5.000 in the first year of your studies. The selection committee has the option to grant a double scholarship of € 10.000 or a triple scholarship of € 15.000.', 'AGE No age requirement GPA Min. GPA: 3 out of 4.00 ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 72 NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Not required DOCUMENTS You meet the specific requirements of the institution of your choice. You can find these on the website of the institution OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.', 'Schoters', 'https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/nl-scholarships-universities-of-applied-sciences-386', 'https://www.studyinnl.org/finances/nl-scholarship', '[-0.025528494268655777, -0.024989355355501175, 0.0023889392614364624, -0.04881032928824425, -0.014230815693736076, -0.03352576121687889, -0.09572944045066833, 0.0856015533208847, 0.019907280802726746, 0.03497747331857681, -0.015138971619307995, -0.0523158460855484, -0.06361328810453415, -0.008940843865275383, -0.11716530472040176, -0.05103955417871475, -0.045948613435029984, -0.032055821269750595, -0.05941934883594513, -0.0520717054605484, 0.027444303035736084, -0.012278403155505657, 0.076031893491745, -0.05381869897246361, -0.002880807500332594, -0.0580081008374691, -0.0036369876470416784, -0.040607914328575134, 0.04401491582393646, 0.030849287286400795, -0.018594227731227875, 0.08744850009679794, -0.04231647029519081, -0.01685476303100586, 0.029026705771684647, 0.09057072550058365, -0.028515243902802467, -0.01827053725719452, -0.0015708967112004757, 0.047535721212625504, 0.0072814179584383965, -0.009606952778995037, -0.0051124366000294685, -0.008915855549275875, 0.08073020726442337, -0.10247098654508591, -0.028270017355680466, -0.09322486072778702, -0.03131899982690811, -0.0003312715271022171, -0.16283784806728363, 0.019330870360136032, 0.013805758208036423, 0.008248543366789818, -0.044306885451078415, -0.029683563858270645, 0.02230869233608246, -0.00796052161604166, -0.0973520055413