ess of a family’s financial situation.', 'AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 85 Duolingo NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test () SAT DOCUMENTS 1. Common Application, OR Coalition App with Scoir. There’s no application fee. 2. Transcript(s) 3. 2 Letters of Recommendation 4. Proof of English Language Proficiency (see additional information below) 5. SAT or ACT scores (optional for all students) School codes: SAT: 003279, ACT: 1808 6. CSS Profile (only if applying for need-based aid) OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.', 'Schoters', 'https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/clark-university-presidential-scholarship-490', 'https://www.clarku.edu/financial-aid/', '[-0.052897434681653976, -0.0043802522122859955, -0.024224406108260155, -0.05836296081542969, 0.0152616947889328, -0.020225541666150093, -0.09865154325962067, 0.08595077693462372, -0.013881871476769447, 0.037334345281124115, -0.0025626285932958126, -0.012684527784585953, -0.03692161664366722, -0.00990895926952362, -0.13215117156505585, -0.03152254596352577, -0.04353790730237961, 0.006189929321408272, -0.07118988037109375, -0.03362157195806503, 0.015234576538205147, -0.00937192514538765, 0.08499575406312943, -0.033221397548913956, -0.014612650498747826, -0.009520160034298897, -0.03618578612804413, -0.016923824325203896, 0.020375588908791542, 0.02656857669353485, -0.012165507301688194, 0.08891606330871582, -0.01311330683529377, -0.03207799047231674, 0.02991410158574581, 0.04719472676515579, -0.039798296988010406, -0.011354071088135242, 0.01291533000767231, 0.052887432277202606, 0.00138749647885561, -0.047169532626867294, -0.0026005080435425043, -0.00447408203035593, 0.08506941050291061, -0.07242060452699661, -0.044179558753967285, -0.0751342847943306, 0.0018224517116323113, 0.021344110369682312, -0.1426049768924713, 0.029747631400823593, -0.03460310027003288, -0.021249784156680107, -0.029029114171862602