ains a 3.0 grade point average at the University of Delaware.', 'AGE No age requirement GPA No GPA requirement ENGLISH TEST IELTS: min. 7 TOEFL iBT: min. 79 Duolingo PTE Academic TOEFL PBT TOEFL CBT NATIONALITY Indonesian OTHER LANGUAGE Not required STANDARDIZED TEST Standardized Test (Not Required) SAT, ACT, A-Level, IB DOCUMENTS 1. Application form/Common App 2. ⁠High School or secondary school transcript* 3. English proficiency score *Applicants who are attending or have previously attended an international college/university must provide a credential evaluation from the International Education Research Foundation (IERF) OTHERS No other specific requirements mentioned.', 'Schoters', 'https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/university-of-delaware-merit-scholarship-499', 'https://www.udel.edu/apply/undergraduate-admissions/financing-your-degree/scholarships/', '[0.007819391787052155, -0.015839561820030212, 0.019403183832764626, -0.003736559534445405, 0.05607474222779274, -0.01959935948252678, -0.06223278120160103, 0.08052991330623627, -0.0057822586968541145, -0.01049135159701109, -0.022980595007538795, -0.08523371815681458, -0.03840058669447899, -0.036678068339824677, -0.0755438432097435, -0.048858702182769775, -0.05884001404047012, -0.03037532977759838, -0.01947251707315445, -0.06488927453756332, 0.0016964029055088758, -0.03357778862118721, 0.09814264625310898, -0.0030997940339148045, 0.005517555400729179, -0.08345113694667816, 0.019227642565965652, -0.04378321021795273, -0.04701114445924759, -0.005325016099959612, -0.01835465244948864, 0.1053878664970398, -0.012556254863739014, 0.012657408602535725, 0.05332522094249725, 0.10001332312822342, 0.05300913006067276, -0.04167485237121582, -0.05642426013946533, 0.04686358571052551, -0.045393478125333786, -0.029539456591010094, -0.019564468413591385, -0.04673171788454056, 0.08581732213497162, -0.017704375088214874, -0.04767316207289696, -0.03917233273386955, -0.027012210339307785, 0.08511648327112198, -0.12593096494674683, 