n TOEFL/IELTS score Personal Statement (Resume / Curriculum Vitae) Recommendation of an academic referee (online or by hardcopy) Ijazah - Sekolah Menengah Atas (SMA) (Diploma - General Senior Secondary School) with an overall average of 80%; or Ijazah - Madrasah Aliyah (MA) (Diploma - Islamic Senior Secondary School) with an overall average of 80% OTHERS To facilitate outstanding candidates in making informed decisions among all early offers they receive from various universities, candidates who apply to CUHK on or before 16 November 2023 will be considered for an advance offer. In this round, successful applicants may be given a firm or conditional offer depending on individual merits, and those selected for adv', 'Schoters', 'https://www.schoters.com/id/beasiswa/the-chinese-university-of-hong-kong-cuhk-admission-scholarships-552', 'https://www.gs.cuhk.edu.hk/admissions/', '[0.003419529413804412, 0.020769992843270302, 0.03813941404223442, -0.018171241506934166, -0.03258708491921425, 0.034247491508722305, -0.0556768923997879, 0.02074947953224182, 0.003988965880125761, -8.158358104992658e-05, 0.08159175515174866, -0.10380981117486954, -0.0565636120736599, -0.08537968248128891, -0.04134857654571533, -0.025225916877388954, -0.029112815856933594, -0.032074570655822754, -0.05031919479370117, -0.05140717700123787, -0.0026703074108809233, -0.048863064497709274, 0.0175065565854311, -0.020745273679494858, -0.05798953026533127, -0.10264179855585098, -0.005239222664386034, -0.03774573281407356, 0.02327018789947033, 0.02703084610402584, -0.05877860635519028, 0.1216096431016922, 0.01849127747118473, 0.001762606087140739, 0.050219494849443436, 0.09427555650472641, -0.0063380771316587925, -0.053775355219841, -0.012354929000139236, 0.04698146879673004, -0.008480041287839413, 0.005033784080296755, 0.06774163991212845, -0.01893077977001667, 0.1274162232875824, -0.04802389070391655, -0.058600299060344696, -0.0993836373090744, -0.05541367456316948, 0.04457143321633339, -0.1661441773176